    "edits": [
      {
        "offset": 12051,
        "before": "",
        "after": "# GAMES-INDEX-001 follow-on check\n\n`npm run games-index:check` validates real directory data/SSR, negative fixtures, JSON-LD escaping, and the actual deferred loader using explicit event/timer fixtures. `-- --built` checks the current Next output; `-- --base http://127.0.0.1:3100` checks one loopback production preview and artifact identity. Real navigation, advertising network and responsive QA remain separate.\n\nThe legacy Square/Oval/Pixel goldens are retained. `games-index-compat.mjs` reverses only exact approved source fragments and the three new shared navigation anchors before those old comparisons; the new directory check owns current behavior. Its source-delta fixture is a reviewable compatibility contract, not a replacement for historical evidence. Unrelated source, card text, metadata, SWF and Registry changes still fail.\n",
        "offsetLF": 12051
      }
    ]
  },
